    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Matt Andersen – Making Spirits Bright"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Christmas is coming early- the first 100 tickets sold will receive $5 off; after 100 tickets, the price goes up to $70. </p>\\n<p>Singer, songwriter, and guitarist Matt Andersen is taking the holiday party out on the road again this year, announcing trio shows throughout the Maritimes including at the Astor Theatre on December 17. In his own words, \"I\\'ll be playing a mix of holiday tunes and my own songs to warm us all up on a winter night.\"</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
