        "@value": "Royal Ballet Swan Lake (2024)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Yasmine Naghdi and Matthew Ball star in this pillar of the classical ballet canon. Set to Tchaikovsky\\'s soaring score, his first for ballet.</p>\\n"
      }
